# Test of the Searcher (Q225), a second class-change test for rogues, elven scouts, assassins and
# scavengers, played by a level 39 Scavenger who already holds most of each trophy count (the kills
# below bring each to its count), every script roll pinned to 1 (every drop lands): Luther starts
# it and pays the level 39 set's Dimensional Diamonds; Alex's warrant for Leirynn; ten Delu totems
# of the lizardman shamans (each first hit by a holder of Leirynn's first order calls a Neer
# bodyguard, which this scenario leaves standing); chief Kalkis's fang and the strange map; Alex's
# letter for Borys, whose wine catalog sends the traveller to Tyra; ten red spore dusts of the
# giant fungi for Tyra's Malrukian wine; Borys's old order for Jax; the torn map pieces of the road
# scavengers and hangman trees for Solt's and Makel's maps, which Jax combines; the tree gives the
# rusted key and calls the strong wooden chest (this scenario opens the chest of its npc line,
# whose bypass removes the called one); Alex takes the twenty gold bars for his recommendation;
# Luther gives the Mark of Searcher; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q225_test_of_the_searcher.golden
character Searcher 39
class 54
random always 1
hold 2787 8
hold 2797 8
hold 2801 3
hold 2802 3
script quest.Q225_TestOfTheSearcher
item 2784 2785 2786 2787 2788 2789 2790 2791 2792 2793 2794 2795 2796 2797 2798 2799 2800 2801 2802 2803 2804 2805 2806 2807 2808 2809 7562
page trainer/30690.htm
page guard/30291.htm
page default/30728.htm
page default/30729.htm
page merchant/30420.htm
page default/30730.htm
page default/30627.htm
page default/30628.htm
